# WLISTTP.KEY - the scroll bar of a list of eleven rows (WLLONG.REQ after
# the seed) in a 2-row window, counted exactly: range 0 to 9;
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WLISTTP.SNP.
S START
# SHIFT repeats a line code three times: two lines move (a window's
# rows at most), the window a row.
K SHIFT-D
S SDOWN
K D
S DOWN
# A page down; SHIFT's three page codes move one page; CTRL's second
# gesture is dropped.
K N
S PGDN
K SHIFT-N
S SPGDN
K CTRL-N
S CPGDN
K B
S BOTTOM
K P
S PGUP
# X: the page up alone.
K X
S KIND
K SHIFT-U
S SUP
# Thumb jumps: the window's top on the row dragged to, the selection on
# it; released unmoved, nothing; at the bottom, the End move.
K 3
S THUMB3
K 3
S THUMB3B
K 9
S THUMB9
K 0
S THUMB0
K 5
S THUMB5
K 8
S THUMB8
K 1
S THUMB1
# The keys move the bar as the scroll codes do.
K PGDN
S KPGDN
K DOWN DOWN
S KDOWN
K END
S KEND
K HOME
S KHOME
# A new order counts again; a jump in it.
K TAB
S SERIAL
K 7
S SER7
K TAB
S ID
# G: the End walk drops the line down posted before it.
K G
S BUSYG
